{"id":"454605","name":"熬鱼汤","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/454605/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鱼皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鱼骨头","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/454605/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"清洗干净血水，加料酒盐一会儿。","img":"images/454605/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅烧油（热锅冷油）。","img":"images/454605/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油七成热时，下鱼煎。","img":"images/454605/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"稍煎一会儿，翻面。","img":"images/454605/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"转入电高压锅，加水（水稍宽一点），姜片和葱。","img":"images/454605/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"熬一个小时，好了。","img":"images/454605/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用勺子沥出鱼汤，鱼皮和鱼骨头渣子就不要了。","img":"images/454605/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"浓浓的鱼汤就好了。","img":"images/454605/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"直接喝或煮东西都挺不错哦。","img":"images/454605/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}